{
  "_doc": [
    "Audio rows for tools/lot-pipeline/lot-audio-import.ps1. One row = one staged OGG.",
    "src is relative to the LOT Assets root; dst is relative to content/art/lot/.",
    "variants: N expands {n} in src/dst/purpose to 01..N (one row per variant).",
    "mono: true  -> -ac 1, q 4 (one-shots). mono: false -> channels kept, q 5 (music).",
    "loop: true  -> the decoded sample count must equal the source count resampled to 48k (+-1), or the tool fails.",
    "gainDb: the only loudness knob. No loudnorm, no limiter. Set it from the measured peak column in MANIFEST.md.",
    "soundId: the Granadad SoundId / TrackId / BedLoop the file is staged for. Empty = staged and held, unmapped.",
    "enabled: false rows are listed in MANIFEST.md but not converted unless -IncludeDisabled."
